1577
01:06:32.830 --> 01:06:35.890
Allison would hold auditions for parts and put people on tape.
艾莉森会为角色举行试镜，并把过程录下来。

1578
01:06:36.950 --> 01:06:41.630
They had this idea that they might want to cast an SNL cast member in this role.
他们当时有个想法，想找一位《周六夜现场》的演员来演这个角色。

1579
01:06:42.130 --> 01:06:48.670
And I'm not going to say who, but Mindy said, we watched the tapes that Allison sent over,
我就不说名字了，但敏迪说，我们看了艾莉森发来的录像带，

1580
01:06:48.850 --> 01:06:55.190
and you were so funny that we ended up giving you the role instead of offering it to this SNL cast member.
你表现得太搞笑了，所以我们最终决定把这个角色给你，而不是给那位《周六夜现场》的演员。

1581
01:06:55.190 --> 01:07:00.810
