1582
01:07:00.810 --> 01:07:01.290
A badge of honor.
一种荣誉勋章。

1583
01:07:01.510 --> 01:07:08.070
Yeah, he was like, I can brag that I beat out an SNL cast member for a part on The Office.
是啊，他说，我可以吹嘘自己为了《办公室》里的一个角色打败了《周六夜现场》的演员。

1584
01:07:08.630 --> 01:07:14.670
So he just, he was so sweet and so humble and so grateful and so excited to talk about this.
他真的太贴心、太谦逊、太感激了，谈起这件事时特别兴奋。

1585
01:07:15.170 --> 01:07:16.410
Such a nice guy.
真是个好人。

1586
01:07:16.650 --> 01:07:17.270
He's great.
他很棒。

1587
01:07:17.270 --> 01:07:28.430
All right, well, speaking of our lives crisscrossing with these guest stars, at 16 minutes, 37 seconds, Jenna, Michael gets the first guest to his party, who doesn't stick around,
好了，说到我们与这些客串明星的交集，在16分37秒时，珍娜，迈克尔迎来了派对的第一位客人，但他没待多久，

1588
01:07:28.530 --> 01:07:30.030
because no one's there, and he's like, awkward.
因为现场没人，他觉得很尴尬。

1589
01:07:30.350 --> 01:07:32.710
But it's played by Steve Little.
但他是由史蒂夫·利特尔扮演的。

1590
01:07:33.170 --> 01:07:34.150
I noticed.
我注意到了。

1591
01:07:34.750 --> 01:07:36.210
I love Steve Little.
我超爱史蒂夫·利特尔。

1592
01:07:36.350 --> 01:07:41.150
You guys know he played Uncle Jim in the show I did on Netflix called Haters Back Off.
你们知道他在我出演的Netflix剧集《喷嚏》中饰演吉姆叔叔吧。

1593
01:07:41.150 --> 01:07:48.530
It's based off Miranda Sings, based off that character with Colleen Ballinger and Eric Stocklin and Francesca Reale,
那部剧基于米兰达·辛格的角色，还有科琳·巴林杰、埃里克·斯托克林和弗朗西斯卡·雷亚尔参演，

1594
01:07:48.550 --> 01:07:58.090
and Steve Little and I have maybe one of the most awkward romances, even more awkward than Dwight and Angela, you guys.
我和史蒂夫·利特尔在剧里有一段大概是最尴尬的恋情了，比德怀特和安吉拉还要尴尬，真的。

1595
01:07:58.490 --> 01:08:00.430
I mean, we have a date and a bathtub.
我是说，我们还在浴缸里约过会。

1596
01:08:00.670 --> 01:08:10.490
No, you think that a romance can't get weirder than Dwight and Angela until you watch Haters Back Off and see you and Steve Little, for sure, 100%.
不，你以为恋情不会比德怀特和安吉拉更怪了，直到你看了《喷嚏》，看到你和史蒂夫·利特尔的对手戏，绝对的，百分之百。

1597
01:08:10.490 --> 01:08:13.530
That man could read the phone book, and I'd be cracking up.
那个人就算读电话簿，我都能笑死。

1598
01:08:13.630 --> 01:08:14.790
I'd be laughing so hard.
我会笑得停不下来。

1599
01:08:14.950 --> 01:08:17.210
He is so funny.
他太搞笑了。

1600
01:08:17.410 --> 01:08:27.090
Just everything that comes out of his mouth made me laugh, and we got to improvise a lot together and really create this creepy relationship, and I just love him.
他说的每一句话都让我发笑，我们一起即兴发挥了很多，真的创造出了这种令人毛骨悚然的关系，我太喜欢他了。

1601
01:08:27.210 --> 01:08:30.310
I am a huge, huge Steve Little fan.
我是史蒂夫·利特尔的超级超级粉丝。

1602
01:08:30.510 --> 01:08:36.190
Well, I worked with him on Haters Back Off, but a lot of people knew him from Eastbound and Down, as well as many other things.
我在《喷嚏》里和他合作过，但很多人是从《体育老师笑传》以及其他很多作品里认识他的。

1603
01:08:36.190 --> 01:08:38.690
He's just a really great comedic actor.
他真的是一位非常出色的喜剧演员。

1604
01:08:38.690 --> 01:08:41.710
Well, so, you know, Pam's date did not go great.
那么，你知道的，帕姆的约会不太顺利。

1605
01:08:41.910 --> 01:08:44.070
She says Alan was a bit of a dud, right?
她说艾伦有点无趣，对吧？

1606
01:08:44.370 --> 01:08:44.670
Yeah.
是的。

1607
01:08:45.150 --> 01:08:47.530
It was not a love connection, she says.
她说那并不是一段良缘。

1608
01:08:48.110 --> 01:08:51.150
She says she'll know it when she likes someone again.
她说她再次喜欢上某人时自然会知道。

1609
01:08:51.830 --> 01:08:54.150
Because she already likes that person.
因为她已经喜欢上那个人了。

1610
01:08:54.410 --> 01:08:55.070
She does.
确实如此。

1611
01:08:55.770 --> 01:09:06.190
Then Jim gets off the elevator and discovers Michael is alone in his room with a strobe light and some dance music.
然后吉姆走出电梯，发现迈克尔独自在房间里，开着频闪灯，放着舞曲。

1612
01:09:06.190 --> 01:09:07.870
That's really loud music.
那音乐声真的很大。

1613
01:09:08.290 --> 01:09:09.090
Like, loud.
就是那种，震耳欲聋。

1614
01:09:09.210 --> 01:09:12.010
I couldn't believe no one called and complained on him.
我真不敢相信竟然没人打电话投诉他。

1615
01:09:12.090 --> 01:09:13.070
The music was so loud.
音乐声太大了。

1616
01:09:13.190 --> 01:09:15.590
I know, I'm 100, but I was like, that's very loud.
我知道，我像个百岁老人一样，但我当时就觉得，那声音太吵了。

1617
01:09:16.090 --> 01:09:19.650
Well, Michael is really grouchy.
迈克尔真的很暴躁。

1618
01:09:20.110 --> 01:09:22.170
We don't see Michael like this a lot.
我们很少见到这样的迈克尔。

1619
01:09:22.330 --> 01:09:24.270
He's being super passive-aggressive.
他表现得超级阴阳怪气。

1620
01:09:24.750 --> 01:09:26.050
It's Michael Sass.
这就是迈克尔式的刻薄。

1621
01:09:26.570 --> 01:09:30.050
It's Michael Sass, but I have a little bit of backstory, guys.
这是迈克尔式的刻薄，但我有一点背景故事要告诉大家。

1622
01:09:30.250 --> 01:09:36.170
If you watch the deleted scenes, remember how we said there's some of the Dwight-Angela stuff that plays out that got cut?
如果你看了删减片段，还记得我们说过有些德怀特和安吉拉的戏份被剪掉了吗？

1623
01:09:36.690 --> 01:09:36.810
Yeah.
记得。

1624
01:09:36.810 --> 01:09:40.390
So, you actually see Dwight is checking his watch.
其实你可以看到德怀特在看表。

1625
01:09:40.510 --> 01:09:42.290
He's got to get to Angela in the room.
他得去房间找安吉拉。

1626
01:09:42.350 --> 01:09:47.110
And he makes up a lame excuse, and he leaves Michael alone in his hotel room.
他编了个蹩脚的借口，把迈克尔一个人留在了酒店房间里。

1627
01:09:47.190 --> 01:09:48.690
And Michael's grumpy about that.
迈克尔对此很不爽。

1628
01:09:48.890 --> 01:09:52.530
He's grumpy because he feels like Jim has ditched him for Josh Porter.
他很不爽，因为他觉得吉姆为了乔什·波特把他给甩了。

1629
01:09:52.730 --> 01:09:54.510
So, there's a lot happening here.
所以，这里发生了很多事情。

1630
01:09:54.650 --> 01:09:57.110
Michael feels kind of like his friends have abandoned him.
迈克尔觉得他的朋友们抛弃了他。

1631
01:09:57.110 --> 01:10:04.890
This is also where Jim finally tells Michael, I did not leave because of you, Michael.
这也是吉姆最终告诉迈克尔的地方：迈克尔，我离开不是因为你。

1632
01:10:04.890 --> 01:10:06.130
You were a great boss.
你是个好老板。

1633
01:10:06.310 --> 01:10:07.790
I left because of Pam.
我离开是因为帕姆。

1634
01:10:08.510 --> 01:10:11.010
And Michael's kind of like, you did?
迈克尔当时大概是这种反应：你是因为她？

1635
01:10:11.550 --> 01:10:13.930
That's crazy because Pam's single now.
那太疯狂了，因为帕姆现在单身。

1636
01:10:14.150 --> 01:10:16.090
You can come back.
你可以回来了。

1637
01:10:16.750 --> 01:10:25.930
Well, I also think he wants Jim to know that, but he's also instantly relieved that it wasn't because of him and that his friend is still his friend.
嗯，我也觉得他想让吉姆知道这一点，但他同时也立刻松了一口气，因为吉姆离开不是因为他，而且他的朋友依然还是他的朋友。

1638
01:10:26.290 --> 01:10:26.890
Yes.
没错。

1639
01:10:27.110 --> 01:10:33.110
And Jim, once again, is sharing something incredibly personal with Michael.
而且吉姆再一次向迈克尔分享了极其私人的事情。

1640
01:10:33.550 --> 01:10:33.990
I know.
我知道。

1641
01:10:34.190 --> 01:10:40.070
Because Jim says, listen, man, I put it on the line for Pam twice, and I got rejected twice.
因为吉姆说，听着，伙计，我为帕姆孤注一掷过两次，结果被拒绝了两次。

1642
01:10:40.070 --> 01:10:42.450
I'm just, I'm not going to, I'm not going to call her.
我只是，我不会，我不会再给她打电话了。

1643
01:10:42.590 --> 01:10:42.990
I don't know.
我不知道。

1644
01:10:43.130 --> 01:10:44.930
Like, and I think he has a good point.
我觉得他说得有道理。

1645
01:10:45.490 --> 01:10:47.230
Like, he made his feelings clear.
他已经明确表达了自己的感情。

1646
01:10:47.610 --> 01:10:49.810
He smooched her in the office.
他在办公室里吻了她。

1647
01:10:50.490 --> 01:10:51.990
She knows how he feels.
她知道他的心意。

1648
01:10:52.290 --> 01:10:54.330
He said, I love you.
他说过，我爱你。

1649
01:10:54.650 --> 01:10:54.950
Yeah.
是的。

1650
01:10:54.950 --> 01:10:56.430
He said, I love you.
他说过，我爱你。

1651
01:10:57.050 --> 01:10:58.550
The ball is in her court.
现在主动权在她手里。

1652
01:10:59.370 --> 01:11:00.270
A hundred percent.
百分之百。

1653
01:11:00.590 --> 01:11:05.750
I totally get how he's like, if she called off the wedding and she didn't phone me, what am I supposed to do with that?
我完全理解他的想法，如果她取消了婚礼却没给我打电话，我该怎么办？

1654
01:11:05.830 --> 01:11:09.530
I'm going to go be like, hey, did you call off the wedding now?
我会去问，嘿，你现在取消婚礼了吗？

1655
01:11:09.530 --> 01:11:10.270
Can I have a chance?
我能有机会吗？

1656
01:11:10.550 --> 01:11:10.730
No.
不能。

1657
01:11:11.430 --> 01:11:13.310
Jim's playing this right, in my opinion.
在我看来，吉姆这步棋走对了。

1658
01:11:15.150 --> 01:11:19.670
So then at the end, the Hammer Mill reps show up for the party.
最后，Hammer Mill的代表们出现在了派对上。

1659
01:11:20.370 --> 01:11:21.530
This is so exciting.
这太让人兴奋了。

1660
01:11:21.670 --> 01:11:22.730
They have two guests.
他们带了两位客人。

1661
01:11:22.730 --> 01:11:27.550
And Michael tells them that he and Jim are best friends.
迈克尔告诉他们，他和吉姆是最好的朋友。

1662
01:11:27.770 --> 01:11:28.670
Best friends.
最好的朋友。

1663
01:11:28.870 --> 01:11:29.030
Best friends.
最好的朋友。

1664
01:11:29.490 --> 01:11:32.910
So it ends up being a win for Michael because he gets his friend back.
所以这对迈克尔来说是个赢面，因为他找回了他的朋友。

1665
01:11:32.910 --> 01:11:36.610
He makes a huge, like, sale with Hammer Mill, right?
他做成了一笔大生意，和Hammer Mill，对吧？

1666
01:11:36.870 --> 01:11:39.970
Jan ultimately is impressed with Michael as a salesman.
简最终对迈克尔的销售能力印象深刻。

1667
01:11:40.550 --> 01:11:40.830
Yeah.
没错。

1668
01:11:40.830 --> 01:11:43.130
He's not number two behind Josh Porter.
他不再是排在乔什·波特之后的第二名了。

1669
01:11:43.770 --> 01:11:43.910
No.
没错。

1670
01:11:44.190 --> 01:11:46.430
So Michael has a nice ending here.
所以迈克尔在这里有个不错的结局。

1671
01:11:46.900 --> 01:11:47.430
He does.
确实。

1672
01:11:47.750 --> 01:11:50.750
He goes through a lot at this convention, but in the end, he wins.
他在这次大会上经历了很多，但最终他赢了。

1673
01:11:50.990 --> 01:11:54.510
And we've got a very funny tag at the end of this episode.
这一集结尾还有一个非常有趣的彩蛋。

1674
01:11:55.290 --> 01:11:57.310
Michael and Dwight are in the hotel room.
迈克尔和德怀特在酒店房间里。

1675
01:11:57.530 --> 01:12:01.370
They turn off the lights because they're going to turn on a black light.
他们关了灯，因为他们要打开黑光灯。

1676
01:12:01.590 --> 01:12:02.510
Because it's a party.
因为这是个派对。

1677
01:12:02.510 --> 01:12:03.550
I guess for their party.
我想是为他们的派对准备的。

1678
01:12:04.030 --> 01:12:04.170
Yeah.
是啊。

1679
01:12:04.610 --> 01:12:04.990
Yes.
是的。

1680
01:12:05.190 --> 01:12:08.930
And there are just these splatters all over the room.
房间里到处都是斑点。

1681
01:12:09.910 --> 01:12:14.250
And Dwight says, well, it's either blood, urine, or semen.
德怀特说，好吧，那要么是血，要么是尿，要么是精液。

1682
01:12:15.010 --> 01:12:16.770
And I love Michael's line.
我特别喜欢迈克尔的那句台词。

1683
01:12:17.510 --> 01:12:19.570
He says, God, I hope it's urine.
他说，天哪，我希望那是尿。

1684
01:12:19.930 --> 01:12:21.170
I hope it's urine.
我希望那是尿。

1685
01:12:21.450 --> 01:12:23.110
When do you ever hope it's urine?
你什么时候会希望那是尿呢？

1686
01:12:23.110 --> 01:12:24.550
I think in that situation.
我想在这种情况下会吧。

1687
01:12:25.010 --> 01:12:26.650
This was a really fun episode.
这一集真的很有趣。

1688
01:12:26.650 --> 01:12:28.390
I had such a great time doing it.
我做这一集的时候非常开心。

1689
01:12:28.450 --> 01:12:30.310
It was so fun to rewatch it again.
重温这一集真是太有趣了。

1690
01:12:30.650 --> 01:12:33.070
I just remember laughing a lot.
我只记得当时笑个不停。

1691
01:12:33.410 --> 01:12:35.410
And that was a real joy for me this week.
这对我来说是本周的一大乐事。

1692
01:12:35.530 --> 01:12:36.730
I hope you guys enjoyed it.
希望你们也喜欢。

